# AuditTrail Trader - Architecture Diagram

## Mermaid Source (`.mmd`)

```mermaid
graph LR
    %% Main flow
    A[Market Data Fetch] --> B[Signal Engine]
    B --> C[Risk Gate]
    C -->|approved| D[Onchain Logger]
    C -->|rejected| E[Blocked / Return to Agent]
    D -->|logDecision| F[X Layer: TradeAuditTrail.sol]
    F -->|executeOrder| G[OKX CLI / Order Execution]
    G --> H[Order Filled / Partial / Cancelled]

    %% Governance modules as subgraph
    subgraph Governance["Governance Layers (Ported from sibling MVP)"]
        G1[Data Integrity Gate<br>--- Staleness > 30s → HARD BLOCK<br>--- NaN funding_rate → HARD BLOCK<br>--- Ledger drift > 0.5% → HARD BLOCK<br>--- Orphaned positions → HARD BLOCK]
        G2[Curator Profile Selector<br>--- Fixed allowlist (conservative/standard/defensive)<br>--- Cooldown: 12 cycles between switches<br>--- Auto-revert on underperformance<br>--- Drawdown circuit breaker forces "defensive"]
        G3[Multi-Leg Execution Manager<br>--- State machine: PENDING_FILL → LOCKED → SETTLED<br>--- ABORTED on partial fill or slippage breach<br>--- Per-leg max_slippage_pct enforced (0.3%)<br>--- PaperFillSimulator: no min cap on slippage<br>--- LiveFillSimulator: real orders through OrderExecutor]
        G4[Strategy Validation<br>--- Walk-forward windows (6 folds)<br>--- PBO (Probability of Backtest Overfitting) ≤ 0.5<br>--- Calmar Ratio ≥ 1.0 AND Sharpe ratio<br>--- Cleared for paper trading boolean gate]
        G5[Local Append-Only Audit Log<br>--- JSONL file: audit_log.jsonl<br>--- Records: integrity blocks, curator switches, risk rejections<br>--- Complements on-chain audit trail]
    end

    %% Connections from main flow to governance
    C -->|non-overridable gate| G1
    G1 -->|HARD BLOCK| G2
    G2 -->|profile selector| G3
    G3 -->|risk-checked dispatch| G4
    G4 -->|cleared_for_paper_trading| G5

    %% Styling
    classDef main fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef governance fill:#f1f8e9,stroke:#558b2f,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef block fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;
    classDef allow fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,color:#000;

    class A,B,D,G,H main;
    class G1,G2,G3,G4,G5 governance;
    class C,E block;
</graph>
```

